# The release ships the package, its metadata and the changelog -- nothing else.
#
# The test suite is deliberately **not** shipped: it needs fixtures/, tests/support/ and
# tests/ledger/, which are not distribution artifacts, so a downstream copy could not run it, and
# setuptools' default file list would pull in tests/test*.py alone. Half a test suite is worse than
# none.
include CHANGELOG.md
prune tests
